    "Inspirado en el género de empujar cajas creado por Sokoban (Hiroyuki Imabayashi, 1981). Elkünufe es un juego independiente, sin relación con Sokoban ni con sus titulares; sus niveles, gráficos y sonidos son originales.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inspired by the box-pushing genre created by Sokoban (Hiroyuki Imabayashi, 1981). Elkünufe is an independent game, not affiliated with Sokoban or its owners; its levels, graphics and sounds are original."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Juego": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Game"
